      <table width="590" cellpadding="30" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" align="center" style="line-height: 1.3em;">
       <tr>
        <td valign="top">
         <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">
          Re: National Funding Agreement #{!Opportunity.Merchant_Number__c}
          <br><br>
          Welcome to National Funding.
          <br><br>
          We are pleased that you have chosen us for your financial solutions and feel certain you have made the right decision for your company.
          <br><br>
          Very shortly you will receive a copy of your contract by mail for your files.  Please do not hesitate to call me with questions or issues, should they arise.
          <br><br>
          Our goal is to help you with the success of your business.  I am here to help you with this loan and future needs.  I have provided my contact information below should you need to get in touch with me.
          <br><br>
          Thank you for using National Funding. We look forward to building upon a lasting business relationship with you and your company.
          <br><br>
          Sincerely,
          <br><br>
          <Strong>National Funding</Strong>
          <br><br>
          If you have any questions, please contact our renewal team at: 
          <br>
          Phone: (800) 382-2856
